。"}],"irregularForms":[],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"表示演奏乐器时，乐器前通常用 the。"},{"word":"collect stamps","meaning":"集邮；收集邮票","pos":"v. phrase","phonetic":"/kəˈlekt stæmps/","emoji":"📮","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"collect stamps from different countries","example":"He collects stamps from different countries. / 他收集不同国家的邮票。"}],"irregularForms":[],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[{"word":"collection","pos":"n.","meaning":"收藏；收藏品"}],"tip":"collect 强调有目的地收集。"},{"word":"welcome","meaning":"欢迎；迎接","pos":"v.","phonetic":"/ˈwelkəm/","emoji":"👋","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"welcome someone to a place","example":"We welcome the visitors to our school. / 我们欢迎来访者来到学校。"}],"irregularForms":[],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"welcome 也可作形容词或感叹语，如 Welcome!"},{"word":"work","meaning":"工作；运转；起作用","pos":"v.","phonetic":"/wɜːk/","emoji":"💼","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"work hard","example":"She works hard every day. / 她每天努力工作。"}],"irregularForms":[],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[{"word":"worker","pos":"n.","meaning":"工人；工作者"}],"tip":"work 表示“工作”时通常是不可数名词，也可作动词。"},{"word":"drink","meaning":"喝；饮","pos":"v.","phonetic":"/drɪŋk/","emoji":"🥤","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"drink some milk","example":"The child drinks some milk. / 孩子喝了一些牛奶。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"过去式","form":"drank"},{"label":"过去分词","form":"drunk"}],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[],"tip":"drink 也可作名词，表示“一杯饮料；饮品”。"},{"word":"taste","meaning":"尝；品尝；尝起来","pos":"v.","phonetic":"/teɪst/","emoji":"👅","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"taste delicious","example":"The soup tastes delicious. / 这汤尝起来很美味。"}],"irregularForms":[],"synonyms":[],"wordFamily":[{"word":"tasty","pos":"adj.","meaning":"美味的"}],"tip":"作系动词时，taste 后接形容词，如 tastes good。"},{"word":"smell","meaning":"闻；闻起来；有……气味","pos":"v.","phonetic":"/smel/","emoji":"👃","morphology":[],"collocations":[{"phrase":"smell the flowers","example":"She smells the flowers. / 她闻了闻花。"}],"irregularForms":[{"label":"过去式和过去分词",